    '4-multiply-fractions-whole-numbers' => ['title'=>'Multiply Fractions by Whole Numbers','grade'=>'Grade 4','standard'=>'4.NF.B.4','focus'=>'multiply a fraction by a whole number as repeated addition','vocab'=>'multiple — a product of a number and a whole number; repeated addition — adding equal groups; product — a multiplication result; unit fraction — one equal part; fraction model — a drawing of equal fractional parts','example'=>'Find 3 × 2/5 | Think of 3 groups of 2/5: 2/5 + 2/5 + 2/5. | Add the numerators and keep fifth-size pieces: 6/5. | Rename 6/5 as 1 1/5.','warm'=>'Find 4 × 1/6. | 4/6','guided'=>'Solve 3 × 3/8. | 9/8','independent'=>'A ribbon piece is 2/3 meter long. What is the length of 5 pieces? | 10/3 meters','challenge'=>'Write two different whole-number-times-fraction expressions with a product of 3.'],
